  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아시다시피 미르시티는\n많은 카페가 늘어서 있는 격전지예요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C2DCB2E4C2DCD53C0020BBF8B974C2DCD2F0B294000AB9CEC7400020CE74D398AC000020B298C5B4C11C0020C788B2940020ACA9C804C9C0C608C694002E00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 라이벌 가게를 이길 수 있는\n신메뉴를 개발하고자 주목한 게 바로...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020B77CC774BC8C0020AC00AC8CB97C0020C774AE380020C2180020C788B294000AC2E0BA54B274B97C0020AC1CBC1CD558ACE0C7900020C8FCBAA9D55C0020AC8C0020BC14B85C002E002E002E00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야나프! 바오프! 앗차프랍니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CB098D50400210020BC14C624D50400210020C557CC28D504B78DB2C8B2E4002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "3마리 전부 서로 닮았지만\n각자 매우 다른 특징을 갖고 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0033B9C8B9AC0020C804BD800020C11CB85C0020B2EEC558C9C0B9CC000AAC01C7900020B9E4C6B00020B2E4B9780020D2B9C9D5C7440020AC16ACE00020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야나프의 머리에 난 잎에는\n피로 회복 효과가 있고!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CB098D504C7580020BA38B9ACC5D00020B09C0020C78EC5D0B294000AD53CB85C0020D68CBCF50020D6A8ACFCAC000020C788ACE0002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바오프의 머리털 속에는\n300도의 화염이 불타고 있으며!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14C624D504C7580020BA38B9ACD1380020C18DC5D0B294000A003300300030B3C4C7580020D654C5FCC7740020BD88D0C0ACE00020C788C73CBA70002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗차프의 머리털에 고인 물에는\n영양분이 듬뿍 들어가 있죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C557CC28D504C7580020BA38B9ACD138C5D00020ACE0C7780020BB3CC5D0B294000AC601C591BD84C7740020B4ECBFCD0020B4E4C5B4AC000020C788C8E0002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맞아요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n자양 강장 효과를 가진 잎과 영양 만점의 물!\n최적의 화력을 모두 갖추게 되는 거랍니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC544C694002100100001BE01000AC790C5910020AC15C7A50020D6A8ACFCB97C0020AC00C9C40020C78EACFC0020C601C5910020B9CCC810C7580020BB3C0021000ACD5CC801C7580020D654B825C7440020BAA8B4500020AC16CD94AC8C0020B418B2940020AC70B78DB2C8B2E4002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이런 3마리의 장점을 활용하면\n이상적인 차를 내릴 수 있을 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B7F000200033B9C8B9ACC7580020C7A5C810C7440020D65CC6A9D558BA74000AC774C0C1C801C7780020CC28B97C0020B0B4B9B40020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "만약 이 3마리를 잡으시거든\n제게 빌려주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9CCC57D0020C77400200033B9C8B9ACB97C0020C7A1C73CC2DCAC70B4E0000AC81CAC8C0020BE4CB824C8FCC138C694002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이상적인 차가 완성되면\n제일 먼저 대접해 드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C0C1C801C7780020CC28AC000020C644C131B418BA74000AC81CC77C0020BA3CC8000020B300C811D5740020B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야나프, 바오프, 앗차프는\n가로수같이 높은 곳을 좋아해요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n잡으시거든 3마리를 지닌 포켓몬에 넣고\n제게 보여 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CB098D504002C0020BC14C624D504002C0020C557CC28D504B294000AAC00B85CC218AC19C7740020B192C7400020ACF3C7440020C88BC544D574C694002E00100001BE01000AC7A1C73CC2DCAC70B4E000200033B9C8B9ACB97C0020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE0000AC81CAC8C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오옷! 그 녀석들은\n야나프, 바오프, 앗차프!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C63700210020ADF80020B140C11DB4E4C740000AC57CB098D504002C0020BC14C624D504002C0020C557CC28D504002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "감사합니다!\n그럼 바로 착수해 볼게요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n천천히 기다려 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E40021000AADF8B7FC0020BC14B85C0020CC29C218D5740020BCFCAC8CC694002E00100001BE00000ACC9CCC9CD7880020AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오래 기다리셨습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624B7980020AE30B2E4B9ACC168C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야나프바오프앗차프차...\n일명 ‘삼차’입니다!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n야나프바오프앗차프차라는 이름은\n너무 긴 데다가 순서도 헷갈리니까요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CB098D504BC14C624D504C557CC28D504CC28002E002E002E000AC77CBA8500202018C0BCCC282019C785B2C8B2E4002100100001BE01000AC57CB098D504BC14C624D504C557CC28D504CC28B77CB2940020C774B984C740000AB108BB340020AE340020B370B2E4AC000020C21CC11CB3C40020D5F7AC08B9ACB2C8AE4CC694002E002E002E00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러면 손님!\n갓 내린 차를 맛봐 주세요...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECBA740020C190B2D80021000AAC130020B0B4B9B00020CC28B97C0020B9DBBD100020C8FCC138C694002E002E002E002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떠세요?\n풍미도 향도 영양도 엄청나죠!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A0C138C694003F000AD48DBBF8B3C40020D5A5B3C40020C601C591B3C40020C5C4CCADB098C8E00021003F00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아! 포켓몬들은 돌려드릴게요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54400210020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7400020B3CCB824B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002E00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야나프, 바오프, 앗차프를\n빌려주신 덕분에<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n삼차를 상시 메뉴로 만들 수 있겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CB098D504002C0020BC14C624D504002C0020C557CC28D504B97C000ABE4CB824C8FCC2E00020B355BD84C5D000100001BE00000AC0BCCC28B97C0020C0C1C2DC0020BA54B274B85C0020B9CCB4E40020C2180020C788ACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
